<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">ILNet: Trajectory Prediction with Inverse Learning Attention for Enhancing Intention Capture</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Mingjin Zeng
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Nan Ouyang
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
